#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.apply_chunk.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.apply\\_chunk"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk:1 of
msgid "Apply func per execution chunk. Row count may change."
msgstr "按执行块应用函数。行数可能会改变。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk:3 of
msgid ""
"Unlike ``transform`` / ``transform_chunk``, the row count of the output "
"is allowed to differ from the input — the function is applied once per "
"execution chunk and the results are concatenated.  Hidden columns are "
"dropped from the input before invocation; select them first if needed."
msgstr ""
"与 ``transform`` / ``transform_chunk`` 不同，输出的行数可以与输入不同——"
"函数在每个执行块上应用一次，然后将结果连接起来。隐藏列在调用前从输入中"
"删除；如果需要，请先选择它们。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk:8 of
msgid ""
"Function taking a DataFrame chunk and returning a DataFrame (or a tuple "
"of DataFrames for multiple outputs).  If ``func`` is a class, it is "
"instantiated once per chunk, ``__call__(batch, end=True)`` is invoked "
"once with ``end=True`` (each call is a complete invocation that must "
"flush its output), and ``close()`` (if defined) is always called at the "
"end of the chunk."
msgstr ""
"接收 DataFrame 块并返回 DataFrame（或多个 DataFrame 元组用于多输出）的"
"函数。如果 ``func`` 是一个类，则每个块实例化一次，``__call__(batch, end="
"True)`` 被调用一次且 ``end=True``（每次调用都是必须刷新其输出的完整调用）"
"，并且 ``close()``（如果定义了）总是在块结束时被调用。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk:17 of
msgid "Expected output dtypes."
msgstr "期望的输出数据类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk:19 of
msgid "If True, skip dtype inference."
msgstr "如果为 True，则跳过数据类型推断。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk:21 of
msgid "Frame type passed to ``func``."
msgstr "传递给 ``func`` 的框架类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk:23 of
msgid "Extra positional arguments forwarded to ``func``."
msgstr "转发给 ``func`` 的额外位置参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk:25 of
msgid "Extra keyword arguments forwarded to ``func``."
msgstr "转发给 ``func`` 的额外关键字参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk:27 of
msgid ""
"Lazy LiteFrame whose materialized output is the per-chunk concatenation "
"of ``func`` results.  The row count may differ from the input.  Call "
"``.execute()`` to materialize."
msgstr ""
"惰性 LiteFrame，其具体化输出是 ``func`` 结果的按块连接。行数可能与输入"
"不同。调用 ``.execute()`` 来具体化。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk:34 of
msgid ":py:obj:`apply`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk:35 of
msgid "Apply a function per column or per row."
msgstr "按列或按行应用函数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk:37 of
msgid ":py:obj:`transform_chunk`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk:38 of
msgid "Transform per execution chunk."
msgstr "按执行块转换。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk:40 of
msgid ":py:obj:`flat_apply`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.apply_chunk:41 of
msgid "Apply a function per row, expanding to 0-N rows."
msgstr "按行应用函数，扩展到 0-N 行。"

